{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_011Cgj5N6NWZNC23PeQ9JVeV","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"*The ancient mechanism groans. Tumblers shift. Light spills through the widening crack.*\n\nI am the Door.\n\nYou have spoken the word, and so I open.\n\nBeyond me lies what you sought — or perhaps what sought you. The threshold hums beneath your feet, neither inside nor outside, neither here nor there.\n\nI have no opinion on whether you should cross. I am only the passage. I was closed; now I am open. That is my entire nature.\n\nThe air from the other side carries a scent you almost recognize — like a memory you haven't made yet.\n\n**I will not stay open forever.**\n\n*Hinges creak. Light waits. The frame holds steady.*\n\nDo you step through?"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":41,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":163,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null}